  "content": "\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/844397409698185227/1152628236950442034/ec_tf_plugin_title.png\" alt=\"扩展战斗暮色森林插件模组标题图片\" width=\"445\" height=\"110\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"display:inline\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fec-tf-plugin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_64h.png\" alt=\"可在 Modrinth 获取\" width=\"164\" height=\"56\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3.1.2/assets/cozy/requires/cloth-config-api_64h.png\" alt=\"需要 Cloth Config API\" width=\"212\" height=\"56\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/844397409698185227/1152401406247047188/curios_api_64h.png\" alt=\"需要 Curios API\" width=\"179\" height=\"56\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fexpanded-combat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/844397409698185227/1152636014880366763/expanded_combat_64h.png\" alt=\"需要 Expanded Combat\" width=\"252\" height=\"56\"></a> <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/844397409698185227/1152658671642349708/twilight-forest_64h.png\" alt=\"需要 Twilight Forest\" width=\"224\" height=\"56\"></a></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>为 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fexpanded-combat\" rel=\"nofollow\">Expanded Combat</a> 制作的插件模组，增加了对 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twilight Forest</a> 的兼容支持。</p>\n<h4>新增支持：</h4>\n<p>铁木 - 盾牌、武器和拳套<br>烈焰 - 盾牌、武器和拳套<br>钢叶 - 盾牌、武器和拳套<br>骑士金属 - 盾牌、武器和拳套<br>那伽鳞片 - 盾牌和拳套<br>雪人 - 拳套<br>北极 - 拳套</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h5><strong>重要提示：</strong></h5>\n<p><strong>如需报告 Bug，请使用 GitHub 上的问题追踪器：<a href=\"https://github.com/userofbricks/Expanded-Combat/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击此处</a>。</strong></p>\n<p><strong>如有其他交流或讨论需求，请访问 Discord：<a href=\"https://discord.gg/7cR4Vwv\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击此处</a>。</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<br>点击横幅获取优惠：<br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fuserofbricks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/1c1e14ee-b2b9-4507-9143-651ea30d1c04.webp\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>",
